{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#card-zh","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:871-953","src/pipeline.js:920-978","src/loop.js:150-210","client.js:756-771"],"text":"**dsh-see-now**（DSH Web 客户端插件）：让 AI 实时查看屏幕、摄像头或 OBS 画面。它注册 `see_now` 工具，按画面变化筛选重要帧并拼成一张图返回，还能在有新画面时持续唤醒模型。主要功能包括整屏或自选区域观察、逐场景满幅查看、调节采集节奏和清晰度、查看视频中的语音转写，以及通过设置面板管理参数和悬浮窗。适合需要 AI 跟看屏幕操作、视频或直播内容的用户。运行采集需要 FFmpeg；悬浮窗和音频转写是可选能力，可使用本机配置。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#card-en","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:871-953","src/pipeline.js:920-978","src/loop.js:150-210","client.js:756-771"],"text":"dsh-see-now lets a DSH Web user show an AI a live screen or video. It filters frames by visual change into image sheets and supports continuous watching, region selection, scene mode, and pace controls. Settings can configure the optional floating window and speech transcription. FFmpeg is required."}
