{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-1","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/pipeline.js:920-978","src/pack.js:162-270"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「变化帧拼图」：根据连续画面的变化筛选帧，再把保留的画面排进拼图并作为图像附件返回。通过 `see_now({action:\"watch\"})` 等待新图，画面静止时不会不断发送相同帧。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-2","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/region.js:31-56","src/index.js:878-903","src/capture.js:178-191"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「屏幕区域选择」：用户可拖框选择屏幕矩形，也能传入坐标，插件保存选区供后续观察。调用 `see_now({action:\"region\"})` 选框，传 `region:\"off\"` 可恢复整屏采集。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-3","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:819-869","src/runner.js:95-137"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「场景与采集节奏」：可切换逐场景满幅画面，或选择省电、默认、灵敏和游戏节奏来改变筛帧门槛及唤醒频率。通过 `scene` 和 `pace` 参数调整，切换后会重建相应采集管线。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-4","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/listen.js:653-699","src/index.js:410-430"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「视频语音转写」：在可用的音频回环和转写服务已配置时，可收集视频声音并将识别文本关联到对应画面时间。转写是可选项，状态信息会说明当前是否启用以及最近错误。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-5","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/settings-api.mjs:148-226","client.js:756-771"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「设置面板」：用户可查看当前值和警告，提交观察节奏、转写服务或悬浮窗样式的配置。面板通过插件提供的 `/api/see-now/` 路由读写配置文件，并对无效设置返回拒绝原因。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#feature-6","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/capture.js:130-208","src/index.js:871-953"],"text":"**dsh-see-now** 的功能「多种画面来源」：观察入口可采集桌面屏幕、OBS 虚拟摄像头或普通摄像头，也可从指定路径回放本地视频。通过 `source` 选择来源，文件回放支持按实时速度播放。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#caveat-1","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/capture.js:130-208","src/binaries.js:1-43"],"text":"dsh-see-now 使用 FFmpeg 获取屏幕或视频帧；如果找不到可执行文件，采集会失败，需要安装 FFmpeg 或配置其路径。"}
{"unit_id":"SAOS-3624__dsh-see-now#caveat-2","repo":"SAOS-3624/dsh-see-now","commit":"d7e8d5940926ef1f768f6339e7d951a3182f4594","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/listen.js:930-977","src/listen.js:1026-1042"],"text":"dsh-see-now 的语音字幕依赖可用的音频回环、Python 采集环境和转写服务配置；缺少这些条件时，屏幕画面观察仍可使用。"}
